  "description": "A childhood friendship stretched into a decade-long unrequited love, with feelings carefully hidden behind the excuse of being childhood friends. But when an old friend suddenly reappears, jealousy threatens to unravel everything. Determined to come between the two, he plans to become the storm between summer and autumn. Yet the more he tries to disrupt their bond, the more he finds himself irresistibly drawn to the very person he never expected to fall for.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/3049084850)",
